{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkj_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkj_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd5a79fd4802e91a70e314c19d369e1e2c2f5b0f56c44f6c60bb8ef319f06518", "ja": "横須賀芸術劇場での感謝祭公演を直前に控え\nた、事務員とプロデューサーの一幕です。", "zh": "这是在横须贺艺术剧场的感谢祭公演即将开始前，事务员与制作人的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkj_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkj_01_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "8a9e1758f0ce34219ddb6b5ec77aa133bc362cdb25bb9c72634ea686d401dd6c", "ja": "わぁ～、ここが横須賀芸術劇場なんですね！\n素敵な建物だなぁ。", "zh": "哇～，这里就是横须贺艺术剧场啊！\n好漂亮的建筑呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
