{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkj_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkj_01_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "10b6a8a6d597e4b57f20c2beddf3353f779e4cb9d09883dbe2c41cd8757f90a0", "ja": "皆さんに感謝の気持ちを伝える、感謝祭公演。\nもうすぐ開場ですね！", "zh": "这是向大家表达感谢之情的感恩祭公演。\n马上就要开场了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
